9:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4","children":["Vadodara"," eats well — but finding a genuinely healthy lunch that isn't boring, oily or soggy by the time it reaches your desk was harder than it should be. So we built a delivery-only kitchen in ","Akota"," that does one thing properly: fresh salads and healthy bowls, made to order and delivered cold across ","Baroda","."]}]
a:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4","children":["Our menu mixes global favourites like the ",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/menu/classic-chicken-caesar-salad","className":"font-semibold text-leaf-700 hover:underline","children":"Chicken Caesar"}]," and"," ",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/menu/salad-caprese","className":"font-semibold text-leaf-700 hover:underline","children":"Salad Caprese"}]," with Gujarati-friendly, mostly vegetarian bowls such as the"," ",["$","$L7",null,{"href":"/menu/desi-mango-sprout-salad","className":"font-semibold text-leaf-700 hover:underline","children":"Desi Mango & Sprout Salad"}],". Whether you're an office team in Alkapuri or Race Course, a student near MSU, or a family in Gotri, Vasna-Bhayli or Manjalpur, every bowl is made to taste good and to be honest about what's inside."]}]
